#: desc: The parser state after each line of Makefile.formats-escape
#: trace
test/fixtures/Makefile.formats-escape
#: stdout
== test/fixtures/Makefile.formats-escape
   1 0 0  0  1 \t | ##@ Section with <tags> & ampersands
   2 0 0  0  1 \t |
   3 0 0  1  1 \t | ## Run the tests (use AWK=<variant> & co)
   4 0 1  0  0 \t | test:
   4 ============ => target:[test] +section
   5 0 1  0  0 \t |
   6 0 1  1  0 \t | ## Grouped targets (displayed with a &)
   7 0 1  0  0 \t | a b&:
   7 ============ => target:[a b&]
   8 0 1  0  0 \t |
   9 0 1  1  0 \t | ## A variable with a \ backslash and {braces}
  10 0 0  0  0 \t | VAR := 1
  10 ============ => variable:[VAR]
